{"id":44653,"date":"2025-09-17T07:37:27","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T06:37:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=44653"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:58:47","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:58:47","slug":"lousa-mountain-trail-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lousa-mountain-trail-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Lousa Mountain Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Junta de Freguesia de Lousa, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a entidade Trail4U ir\u00e3o organizar a 25 de Janeiro de 2026 pelas 09h00 horas o Lousa Mountain Trail, em Lousa, concelho de Loures. O Lousa Mountain Trail \u00e9 uma prova de Trail Running, corrida pedestre em Natureza, com tr\u00eas provas, Trail Longo (TL) K24, Trail Curto (TC) 13 e Caminhada.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Com partida e chegada na localidade de Lousa, Concelho de Loures, Distrito de Lisboa, visa a promo\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica e ambiental da regi\u00e3o e da promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio natural.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A prova Lousa Mountain Trail encontra-se inserida no circuito:<br>\u27a2 Merrell Trail Running Series<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46309,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-44653","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lousa-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-con